<title>JAPAN: Canon shares up on expected high profits.</title>
<headline>Canon shares up on expected high profits.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Canon Inc rose on Monday morning after the company forecast a surge in profits for the year to December 31, 1996, traders said.</p>
<p>The share price of the major printer company had gained 30 yen to stand at 2,600 yen by 0152 GMT, on volume of 978,000 shares.</p>
<p>Canon said on Monday that it expects to post a parent current profit of 125 billion yen for the year, up 56 percent from the previous year, thanks to robust sales of its computer-related products.</p>
